Regenerate with benchmarks/magna_reproduction/original_installed_inputs.py.

These are original input texts, not installed Python-wheel results. The Rust
suite copies only the current executable and small local task inputs outside the
checkout, runs corresponding CLI commands and compiled Rust consumers, and
states unsupported Python installation/reflection and Native-cache identities
separately. It reuses the existing compiler/dependency environment.
